flowchart LR
    Request[Incoming request] --> Log[Request logger]
    Log --> Cors[CORS check]
    Cors --> Rate{Rate limit<br/>exceeded?}
    Rate -->|Yes| R429[429 Too many requests]
    Rate -->|No| Authn{Authenticated?}
    Authn -->|No| R401[401 Unauthorized]
    Authn -->|Yes| Authz{Authorized?}
    Authz -->|No| R403[403 Forbidden]
    Authz -->|Yes| Valid{Body valid?}
    Valid -->|No| R422[422 Unprocessable]
    Valid -->|Yes| Handler[Route handler]
    Handler --> Ok[200 OK]
    R429 --> Out[Response logger]
    R401 --> Out
    R403 --> Out
    R422 --> Out
    Ok --> Out
    Out --> Client[Client]

    %% @main Request Log Cors Rate Authn Authz Valid Handler Ok Out Client
    %% @exit Rate -> R429, Authn -> R401, Authz -> R403, Valid -> R422
